gear, not just a standard tow. We handle all of these, 24 hours a day, from our base at 347 39 Ave SE.</p><p>Our tow truck Calgary team covers the main routes drivers use every day: Deerfoot Trail, Stoney Trail, Crowchild Trail, Glenmore Trail, Macleod Trail, the Trans-Canada Highway (Highway 1) and 16 Avenue NW. We also tow across the NE, NW, SE and SW quadrants, to and from the airport area, and out to Chestermere, Airdrie, Cochrane, Okotoks and High River.</p><p>Whether you need emergency towing in Calgary after an accident, a flatbed tow for an AWD or electric vehicle, a jump start on a freezing morning, or help getting your car out of the impound lot, one call to (587) 435-0770 is enough. We confirm the truck, the arrival time and the price before we dispatch.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Generel Sans","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":14,"sizes":[]},"_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"10","right":"0","bottom":"-10","left":"0","isLinked":false},"text_color":"#000000"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":false},{"id":"863aceb","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","margin":{"unit":"px","top":"80","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"margin_tablet":{"unit":"px","top":"50","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"20","bottom":"20","left":"20","isLinked":true},"boxed_width":{"unit":"px","size":1240,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[{"id":"a8363e1","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Divider","color":"#00000026","hide_mobile":"hidden-mobile","__globals__":{"color":""}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"divider"},{"id":"d746a44","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"grid","presetTitle":"Grid","presetIcon":"eicon-container-grid","content_width":"full","grid_columns_grid":{"unit":"fr","size":5,"sizes":[]},"grid_columns_grid_tablet":{"unit":"